OL,3,AEvacuees from Russia-occupied city
OL,4,Awhere residents ate weeds arrive in
OL,5,AUkraine
OL,6,
OL,7,FPeople evacuated from the devastated
OL,8,FRussian-occupied city of Oleshky have
OL,9,Farrived in Ukraine, President Volodymyr
OL,10,FZelensky has confirmed.
OL,12,FResidents of the frontline city had
OL,13,Fbeen trapped without food, water and
OL,14,Felectricity, with many resorting to
OL,15,Fcooking garden weeds to survive.
OL,17,FThe evacuees were taken out of Oleshky
OL,18,Fon Friday during a local ceasefire,
OL,19,Fbrokered by US First Lady Melania
OL,20,FTrump, before travelling through
OL,21,FRussian occupied territory to southern
OL,22,FRussia.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
